# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Decision Index

One line per settled decision, newest at the bottom. This is an **index, not a record** — the
full reasoning stays in the module file or run-log entry linked in the last column. The job of
this file is to answer "when and why did we decide X?" in seconds, without scrolling a run log
that's grown to thousands of lines.

Only index decisions that would be **expensive to re-litigate or that constrain future work** —
a choice between two libraries, a scope boundary, a method that was tried and abandoned, a
standard everything else now depends on. Routine choices don't belong here; if every small call
gets a row, the file stops being scannable and stops being used.

| When | Decision | Why | Detail |
